#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:43
msgid "REAL DEMOCRACY IN ACTION"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:44
msgid "CITIZEN &amp; COMMUNITY ASSEMBLIES"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:45
msgid "The key to unlocking real change across every demand"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:49
msgid ""
"For decades, vital reforms on climate, wealth inequality, housing, and peace "
"have been blocked by short-term party politics and entrenched lobbying "
"interests. <strong>Assemblies are how we break that deadlock.</strong> When "
"ordinary people are given the time, independent evidence, and space to "
"deliberate together, they consistently reach fair, courageous solutions that "
"career politicians refuse to touch."
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:54
msgid "01 // BEYOND GOVERNANCE FAILURES"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:55
msgid "Power in the Hands of the People"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:57
msgid ""
"Instead of outsourcing our future to distant political classes and corporate "
"lobbyists, assemblies put decision-making directly into the hands of "
"everyday citizens and local communities."
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:62
msgid "02 // INFORMED DELIBERATION"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:63
msgid "The Key That Unlocks Every Demand"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:65
msgid ""
"Whether the issue is taxing extreme wealth, restoring nature, or fixing "
"housing, assemblies bring communities and independent experts together to "
"build mandates with real public legitimacy."
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:70
msgid "03 // LOCAL TO GLOBAL"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:71
msgid "From Town Halls to July 3rd"
msgstr ""

#: src/wp-content/plugins/101-map-assemblies.php:73
msgid ""
"Local town halls and grassroots assemblies are meeting now to deliberate, "
"compile local evidence reports, and build towards the mass capital-city "
"convergences on July 3rd."
msgstr ""

